    "created_at": "2022-04-07T10:31:29Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-04-07T10:31:29Z",
    "body": "> Additionally, I wonder whether this could be a source of interoperability issues.\r\n\r\nFor sure. I mean, without wanting to speculate on the development practices of the Office 365 folks, it seems plausible that they tested things in Chrome/Edge and didn't realize that they had some rPH calls that were effectively no'opd, which would cause issues in other browsers.\r\n\r\n(We shipped a site-specific change to remediate the user-facing issue on the Office site.)",
